    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "3ed5e0e7-93a9-31e5-ba49-bdbabf920793",
                "word": "twelvemonth",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "9f3efa7b-5411-4e89-bdea-2f030b558289",
                        "entry_id": "3ed5e0e7-93a9-31e5-ba49-bdbabf920793",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "twelvemonths"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e2bfb407-386f-3f19-889a-c98f771e1b4f",
                        "entry_id": "3ed5e0e7-93a9-31e5-ba49-bdbabf920793",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A year."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1d5ed021-e3d9-44c3-9f4c-5be8f61b2511",
                                "sense_id": "e2bfb407-386f-3f19-889a-c98f771e1b4f",
                                "text": "But last February, almost a twelvemonth back, she suddenly disappeared."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0e925d53-f45e-4074-b9be-b412f32a89ff",
                                "sense_id": "e2bfb407-386f-3f19-889a-c98f771e1b4f",
                                "text": "Take the annals of the majority of hearths for a twelvemonth, and we should be amazed at the quantity of wretchedness that would be writ in them, if writ truly."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "221a750e-4dd2-4cd7-907c-b0000a60567f",
                                "sense_id": "e2bfb407-386f-3f19-889a-c98f771e1b4f",
                                "text": "For, owing to the large number of whale-cruisers; the disorderly way they were sprinkled over the entire watery circumference, many of them adventurously pushing their quest along solitary latitudes, so as seldom or never for a whole twelvemonth or more on a stretch, to encounter a single news-telling sail of any sort; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "384a6533-31c4-411d-8cd7-bb6529ef5a78",
                                "sense_id": "e2bfb407-386f-3f19-889a-c98f771e1b4f",
                                "text": "She was ill very nigh a twelvemonth altogether; and I had to nurse her as best as I could, and clean the house, and cook, and make her gruel and everything, for we could not afford to pay a woman to help us."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "af8c8272-70de-420b-9155-47146e6d947f",
                                "sense_id": "e2bfb407-386f-3f19-889a-c98f771e1b4f",
                                "text": "The time of year a twelvemonth past, / When Fred and I would meet, / We needs must jangle, till at last / We fought and I was beat."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "156de5f8-fb53-439a-8b4b-9e97b817ac41",
                                "sense_id": "e2bfb407-386f-3f19-889a-c98f771e1b4f",
                                "text": "Then they were moved away from the field that had stood fallow for a twelvemonth and there a third and last ploughing preluded the planting of the wheat and other seed for the coming year."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
